        "parameters": {
          "content": "## ghost-mastodon-publisher\nGhost EN publish event -> one curated toot on mastodon.social/@criptonautas.\n\nSetup: Ghost Admin (en.criptonautas.co) -> Settings -> Integrations -> custom integration -> Add webhook:\n- Event: **Post published**\n- Target URL: the production URL of **Ghost Webhook** with ?event=published appended\n\nEdits do not repost. Republishing an already-posted article is deduped by ghost-mastodon-post-one (data table mastodon_posts). Failures alert via workflows-errors-ntfy.",
